#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilización"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca4.8.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A standard way to run this program is by simply specifying the following "
"command at the prompt <userinput><command>kbuildsycoca4</command></userinput>"
